		<description><![CDATA[I remember Musawwir with deep affection. He was kind, real, here for others, and so dedicated to the Sufi message.  May his soul be blessed with the vision of and union with the Beloved and may his loved ones left here without him be blessed with gratitude for sharing this life together. 
