		<pubDate>Thu, 10 Jul 2014 22:20:35 +0000</pubDate>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://remembrance.sufipaths.net/?page_id=1144#comment-26348</guid>
		<description><![CDATA[My most vivid memory of Musawwir is from the year he was the camp director at Pema Osel Ling (?) and he christened me Dorothy the Dutiful, and I addressed him as Musawwir the Magnificent. We had many chuckles over that and it was a wonderful collaboration. I haven&#039;t seen him since but have often thought of him that way.]]></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>My most vivid memory of Musawwir is from the year he was the camp director at Pema Osel Ling (?) and he christened me Dorothy the Dutiful, and I addressed him as Musawwir the Magnificent. We had many chuckles over that and it was a wonderful collaboration. I haven&#8217;t seen him since but have often thought of him that way.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
